# Generated completion fixtures are compared byte for byte by
# `test/integrations_test.dart`, so their line endings must not follow the
# checkout platform. `core.autocrlf=true` rewrites them to CRLF on Windows and
# the comparison then fails at the first line break. They are also shell,
# PowerShell, and YAML sources, where a carriage return is a defect rather
# than a preference.
fixtures/**/completions/** -text